        "ParentObjectID": "hw_casting_bones",
        "LocalizationKey": "HarshWilds_CastingBones_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A handful of small bones, scraped clean and marked with charcoal, kept in a fold of hide. Cast on the ground, they show whether the eagle or the black bear is close to coming for your food."
    },
